              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nitsiba khuHaruni nende abaanabe olwa baleenjilanga mwiheema liokhwakaana, kata olwa balasitanga ahambi khushimalilo shiemisango okhukhalabanila habundu ahatakatifu, mbu baleshe okhwituukha obwonooni nibafwa; lino lilabeetsenje lilako obushia nobushia khuye khandi khunzibulotsie munyumawe.",
          "type": "text",
